  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Control plane",
      "items": [
        "The gateway is the only exposed service: JWT login, per-project RBAC, append-only audit log",
        "Metadata (users, versioned flows, runs, datasources, encrypted connections) lives in PostgreSQL",
        "The scheduler runs inside the gateway: on cron it launches flows in production mode on the production engine"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Data plane",
      "items": [
        "Every preview and every run is a Celery task: the preview queue stays responsive during long runs",
        "Engines run in-process in the worker (Polars, DuckDB, chDB); cloud ClickHouse is an optional remote engine",
        "Content-addressed step cache: parquet under cache/ plus an index on Valkey, 24 h TTL swept hourly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Storage and boundaries",
      "items": [
        "One bucket: datasets/ (snapshots), cache/ (steps), out/ (results); MinIO locally, Scaleway S3 in the cloud",
        "Source databases are ingested as streaming Arrow → parquet; Output nodes write datasources, tables or S3",
        "VictoriaMetrics scrapes the Engine API /metrics, celery-exporter, cAdvisor and node-exporter; Grafana shows them"
      ]
    }
  ]
